OL,3,ANew York building collapse kills at
OL,4,Aleast four people
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least four people have died after a
OL,7,Fbuilding in New York City collapsed
OL,8,Finto an open construction site on
OL,9,FWednesday afternoon.
OL,11,FNineteen others have been injured, of
OL,12,Fwhom four are in a critical condition,
OL,13,Faccording to the BBC's US partner CBS
OL,14,FNews, which cited local officials.
OL,16,FThe collapse sparked a massive
OL,17,Fsearch-and-rescue operation, with more
OL,18,Fthan 250 first responders going to the
OL,19,Fscene of the fallen three-storey
OL,20,Fbuilding in Brooklyn.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
